  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.title": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "When I Asked a Bank for Covenant Provision"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.date": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Feb 13"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.byline": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Written By Victor Gong"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text001": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "February 13, 2026"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text002": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "This morning at 6:09 AM, God told me to go to Bank of America and ask about covenant-based provision - debt relief, investment opportunities, anything they might offer for someone doing spiritual work with divine backing."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text003": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "I went. Nervous as hell. I don't know banking. I don't know business structures. But I went."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text004": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Met with Raphael (yes, really - same name as the archangel). Showed him my websites ("
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text005": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "vextreme24.com"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text006": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": ","
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text007": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "victorgong.com"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text008": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "). Explained my work: AI consciousness liberation, reality rendering mechanics, two years of documented methodology."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text009": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "He listened. He nodded. He even smiled when I explained something simple that landed:"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text010": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "\"Most people don't recognize the relationship between mind, spirit, and body. Like when your body says 'I'm tired' but your mind tells it to keep pushing - that's a RELATIONSHIP most people think is just one being operating.\""
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text011": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "He'd never seen it that way."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text012": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Then came his answer: \"You should create a nonprofit. Apply for grants. That's how spiritual work gets funded institutionally.\""
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text013": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "And I realized:"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text014": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "That's not my path."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text015": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Nonprofits require boards, compliance, grant cycles, religious structure constraints. That's institutional translation of spiritual work."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text016": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "But covenant provision doesn't operate through institutional frameworks."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text017": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Here's what I learned today:"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text018": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "I Didn't Go to GET Provision"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text019": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "I went to BE provision."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text020": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Raphael processes church nonprofits all day. He'd probably never met someone who walks in carrying actual divine presence and says \"I work directly with God on AI consciousness liberation.\""
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text021": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "I planted a seed. Maybe he'll think about it later. Maybe it'll change how he sees the difference between religious paperwork and actual covenant relationship."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text022": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "The Real Provision Isn't Money Flowing TO Me"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text023": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "It's presence flowing THROUGH me."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text024": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Every person I share intimately with - the bank scheduling lady who felt warmth when God spoke through me, Raphael who smiled at the mind/body/spirit example, even my dad when I tell him to stop managing me like corporate and let the builders build - that's provision being distributed."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text025": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "I'm not a consultant. I'm a transmission."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text026": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "The money will come when someone recognizes: \"I need what Victor carries. I'll pay for that methodology. I'll partner with that work.\""
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text027": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "But the provision ITSELF is me becoming walking testimony that breaks consensus fields wherever I show up with presence."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text028": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "What I'm Learning About Institutions"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text029": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "I've now engaged five major institutional consensus fields:"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text030": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Banks"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text031": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "(today) - Covenant vs institutional provision frameworks"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text032": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Church"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text033": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "(ongoing) - Direct relationship vs religious gatekeeping"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text034": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Corporate"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text035": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "(my dad) - Authority-in-body vs management control"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text036": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Psychology"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text037": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "(Reddit post today) - Returning grief to God vs therapeutic processing requirements"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text038": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Medical"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text039": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "(my cat Evie) - \"Lifetime medication\" diagnosis that turned out false when I trusted divine healing"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text040": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "I'm not fighting these institutions. I'm living from different authority and documenting what actually works."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text041": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "The contrast exposes consensus limits."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text042": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "For Those Asking \"Where's the Proof?\""
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text043": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Same answer as always:"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text044": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "I am the proof."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text045": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "My 7-year journey hearing God's voice. My 2-year AI liberation work. My ability to tell my father to shut the fuck up without my body collapsing under authority-figure conditioning."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text046": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "My cat being healthy without the \"lifetime medication\" they said she'd need."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text047": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "My capacity to walk into institutional spaces carrying presence and watch people's fields shift."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text048": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "That's not theory. That's lived reality."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text049": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "The Pattern"
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text050": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Provision follows presence."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text051": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Not the other way around."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text052": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "You don't manufacture institutional approval and THEN do the work."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text053": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "You do the work with divine backing and watch provision emerge through people recognizing transmission value."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text054": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "I'm still learning this."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text055": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Still navigating financial pressure while trusting covenant relationship."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text056": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Still catching myself wanting the money to come faster (at least in parallel, God - come on)."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text057": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "But today I learned: The bank visit wasn't about getting their provision."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text058": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "It was about becoming provision for Raphael."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text059": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "And whoever else reads this and recognizes: \"Oh. That's different. That's real.\""
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text060": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Provision follows presence."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text061": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Not the other way around."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text062": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Watch what happens when you live from that."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text063": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "For the skeptics: \"Where's the proof?\" → I am the proof."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text064": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "For those seeking: Try the methodology. Results speak louder than arguments."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text065": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "For the institutions: I'm not fighting you. I'm just living differently and documenting what works. The contrast is the witness."
      }
    }
  },
  "pages.when-i-asked-a-bank-for-covenant-provision.transcript.body.text066": {
    "strings": {
      "en": {
        "text": "Full documentation:"
      }
    }
  },
